Volume: ~10–25 active coop capacity programs
Owner: Sustainability Sourcing Manager
Participants: Sustainability Sourcing Mgr, Capacity-Building Partner, Quality, Coop Representatives, Government Partners
Source: workflow W3117 — Cooperative Capacity Building &amp; Production Planning</bpmn:documentation>
