    <bpmn:process id="W_W3118" name="W3118. Cooperative Quality Standards &amp; Inspection Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New coop onboarding; new SKU; quality drift
Frequency: Per onboarding + periodic re-baseline
Volume: Per coop/SKU
Owner: Quality Manager
Participants: Quality, Sustainability Sourcing Mgr, Coop Representatives
Source: workflow W3118 — Cooperative Quality Standards &amp; Inspection Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3118_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3118_Lane1" name="Quality Inspector">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3118_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3118_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3118_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3118_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3118_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3118_Start3" name="New coop onboarding; new SKU; quality drift">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3118_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3118_Task4" name="Quality defines product specification: dimensions, materials, finish…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Quality defines product specification: dimensions, materials, finish, packaging/labeling, lot/traceability codes, product-safety compliance (links to VS-31/VS-89); translates to visual standard and acceptance criteria understandable to coop artisans
Responsible (R): Quality Inspector
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3118_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3118_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3118_Task5" name="Quality delivers on-site training to coop: spec walkthrough, defect examples…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quality delivers on-site training to coop: spec walkthrough, defect examples, self-inspection checklist, sampling plan (AQL); certifies coop&#x27;s designated quality lead
Responsible (R): Quality Inspector / Coop Quality Lead
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3118_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3118_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3118_Task6" name="Quality implements incoming inspection at BuildRight DC (links to VS-04 W3…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quality implements incoming inspection at BuildRight DC (links to VS-04 W3 inbound): AQL sampling, defect classification (critical/major/minor), disposition (accept/reject/rework), and feedback to coop for continuous improvement
Responsible (R): Quality Inspector
Accountable (A): Quality Manager
Duration: Per receipt</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3118_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3118_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3118_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3118_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
